  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technologies Applied to Advances in Documentation (RENAPER).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The present Project aims to develop cooperation and technical assistance activities for the National Directorate of the National Registry of Persons (RENAPER), under the Ministry of the Interior, Public Works, and Housing, to strengthen its management capacities for the implementation of technologies aimed at modernizing the equipment and processes related to the document issued under Law No. 17,671 and its complementary regulations.</narrative>
  </description>
